The crate manifest and wrapper are local research scaffolding. Windows release
tests passed offline with the lockfile: 23 unit tests and 9 adversarial tests.
They include v2/v3 synthetic gift-wrap handling and an explicit outer signature
and sender-key check. This is not evidence of cross-client interoperability,
network delivery, a trusted contact registry or payments.
